addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OZAWA YUMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAMURA FUMINORI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AKIMOTO, MASAHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OZAWA, YUMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAMURA, FUMINORI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Freeze-dried preparations containing a platinum (II) complex of formula (1) as the main component. The freeze-dried preparations have an excellent storability and a rapid solubility in injection water to make the handling in the administration of the preparations easy in the medical treatment. They have such features that they do not necessitate any special storing method such as cold storage or freezing.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Cette invention se rapporte à des préparations lyophilisées contenant comme composant principal un complexe de platine (II) représenté par la formule (1). Ces préparations lyophilisées ont une excellente aptitude au stockage et une solubilité rapide dans l'eau d'injection, facilitant ainsi leur manipulation lors de l'administration de ces préparations dans un traitement médical. Ces préparations ont des caractéristiques telles qu'elles ne nécessitent aucun procédé de conservation spécial, tel que conservation à froid ou congélation.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyrig